<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Hello,</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Oregon State Police has launched a new, streamline=
d process for submitting public records requests. Effective immediately, al=
l requests must be submitted using our electronic request form.
<span style=3D"color:#0070C0"></span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><b><span style=3D"color:#0070C0">&nbsp;</span></b>=
</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><b><u>We are no longer accepting requests via emai=
l</u>.<span style=3D"color:#0070C0">&nbsp;
</span>To submit a request, please use the following link: </b><a href=3D"h=
ttps://forms.osp.oregon.gov/forms/prrrecordsrequest"><b>https://forms.osp.o=
regon.gov/forms/prrrecordsrequest</b></a><b><span style=3D"color:#0070C0"><=
/span></b></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">You can also access this form through our website =
at oregon.gov/osp under the =93How do I request a public record=94 section.=
</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">This form should be used for both general public r=
ecords requests and requests from public agencies.</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Please allow at least 30 days for processing befor=
e following up on the status of your request.&nbsp; For all other inquiries=
, we strive to respond to emails within 1=962 business days.
</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Thank you for your cooperation as we work to impro=
ve our service.<span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><=
/span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
